  "notes": [
    "Non-upgradeable router with no storage read by the exploit; the defect sits in the router, not in Ekubo Core or an extension, so the router's deployment sets the age.",
    "Campaign: every transaction in which the router pulled tokens by transferFrom from an address other than its caller, found from Transfer logs into Core by accounts that had approved the router and confirmed by trace. None precede the anchor; zero-amount pulls, one failed attempt and a net-zero sweep are excluded.",
    "Loss nets each victim's flows per transaction; copycat drains of USDC, cbBTC, EKUBO, LINK and USDT approval holders are included."
